if(/\b(help|commands|what can you do)\b/.test(t))return 'SERAPHIM commands: “progress”, “show quests”, “complete [quest title]”, “reopen [quest title]”, “add quest [title]”, “open cryo chamber”, “open ascension questline”, “open telemetry”, “open intelligence”, “voice check”, and “take five” or “hibernate” to put SERAPHIM into standby. Say “SERAPHIM”, “wake up”, or “wake word” to wake the core again. Quest actions use ASCENSION’s existing Questline; Cryo Chamber does not keep a duplicate board. Live AI reasoning requires the configured secure endpoint.';
